40. 720.8899999999999864 Td
(A critical runtime database error was identified when users attempted to modify their Daily Calorie Goal from 2,000 kcal to 1,900) Tj
T* (kcal in the Daily Health Log. The API returned HTTP 500 with "no such table: user_targets". Root cause investigation confirmed) Tj
T* (that query helpers \(getCanonicalUserNutritionGoals and saveCanonicalCalorieGoal\) in api/nutrition/db.js referenced user_targets) Tj
T* (without a corresponding CREATE TABLE migration during database initialization. The table schema and persistent SQLite table) Tj
T* (have been introduced with full backwards compatibility, multi-target history tracking, and synchronous reconciliation across) Tj
T* (Today's Plan, Daily Health Log, and Home Dashboard.) Tj
